<p>Allows you to burrow into earthen walls for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.</p><p>Your powerful digging abilities also allow you to exploit and smash through enemy defensive weaknesses; You ignore <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">26, 32, 37, 40, 44</acronym> of target armor and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">13%, 16%, 18%, 20%, 22%</acronym> of enemy physical damage resistance while this is in effect.</p><p>At Talent Level 5, this talent can be used instantly, and the cooldown will reduce with levels.</p><p>Each point in sand drake talents also increases your physical resistance by 0.5%.</p>